      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING HENRY (1) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing eight from 15 starts. Finished in the minors latest when second (29.82) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Solid record here winning two races. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Rates highly and will give a great sight. RARE EARTH (6) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (22.97) at this track in a Grade 5. Lines up from box 6 for the first time. Form here excellent including two wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Expected to feature again. BOX FLY BANDIT (2) was in winning form two back (29.81) at Wentworth Park but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Better than last start and can bounce back. ZIPPING FERLAZZO (3) is worth some thought after placing at this track and distance last start.",
